#. Description of the theme
#: style.css
msgid ""
"A block theme for record shops and second-hand music dealers: vinyl, CD, "
"cassettes and merchandise. Covers take center stage, sections and the artist"
" index look like the dividers of a record bin, and prices sit on round "
"stickers. Works on its own for a shop blog and pages; pair it with the Wax "
"Store Catalog plugin for the catalog, filters, grading and copies for sale."
msgstr ""

